# Credentials — NEVER commit these.
# The Firebase service-account JSON and the WA key are live private keys; anyone
# with them can act as this project. Keep them out of git even by accident.
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
WA key.txt
*.pem
*.key
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Build artefacts / release binaries — large and reproducible.
*.apk
*.aab
*.zip

